#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:5
#: ced94d5e63fd4c70b1a8a627d7b830ad
msgid "旧版自旋螺旋（Spin Spiral）"
msgstr "Legacy Spin Spiral"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:7
#: c35818e642d24689813f7e3d108410f7
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "**Category:** Magnetism"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:9
#: 6955d32b47ea470ea15e20e43da93897
msgid ""
"[!WARNING] 这是一张仅用于加载旧工作流的兼容卡片，已从“新建卡片”目录隐藏。新建有限 q、Bloch、cycloidal "
"或一般螺旋路径请使用 [SOC / 纹理响应](soc-texture-response-card.md)。"
msgstr ""
"[!WARNING] This compatibility card is retained only for loading legacy "
"workflows and is hidden from `Add New Card`. For new finite-q, Bloch, "
"cycloidal, or general spiral paths, use [SOC / Texture Response](soc-"
"texture-response-card.md)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:12
#: 37dfa7c18609462992da4596e24805cb
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:14
#: 85a11af8a6e94352910e240e5d2d06dd
msgid "旧版卡片按原子在传播轴上的投影坐标写入螺旋磁矩，并枚举周期、相位、手性和锥分量。它保留每个原子的磁矩模长，只改变方向。"
msgstr ""
"The legacy card assigns spiral moments from each atom's projected "
"coordinate along a propagation axis and enumerates period, phase, "
"chirality, and cone component. It preserves each atom's moment magnitude "
"and changes only its direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:16
#: 6fcc77b9458b432c963042dee60c0f74
#
msgid "该能力与 `SOC / 纹理响应` 的有限 q 路径重复；新版卡片还提供完整路径、共格失败和响应元数据合同，因此不再为旧版卡片新增功能。"
msgstr ""
"This capability overlaps with the finite-q path in `SOC / Texture "
"Response`. The newer card also defines complete-path, commensurability-"
"failure, and response-metadata contracts, so no new features are being "
"added to the legacy card."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:18
#: fbee92e5b2274e158b9e003c22533f1b
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:20
#: b96a1faf71aa4a4db05df45300d5eeba
msgid "对第 $i$ 个原子，旧版卡片生成"
msgstr "For atom $i$, the legacy card generates"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:22
#: 4945afc4a4864c248c30e13613765e2d
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf m_i=M_i\\left\\{\\sqrt{1-m_\\parallel^2}\n"
"[\\cos\\phi_i\\,\\mathbf e_1+\\sin\\phi_i\\,\\mathbf e_2]\n"
"+m_\\parallel\\hat{\\mathbf n}\\right\\},\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:28
#: b872d4ec0a8a4bd39df5961714cf93c8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\phi_i=s\\frac{2\\pi u_i}{L}+\\phi_0,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:32
#: e7dc0811424c436ebadce3d69f83b77a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"其中 $M_i$ 是输入磁矩模长，$u_i$ 是原子坐标在笛卡尔传播轴 $\\hat{\\mathbf n}$ 上的投影，$s=\\pm1$ "
"表示两种手性。$m_\\parallel=0$ 为平面螺旋，$0<|m_\\parallel|<1$ 为锥形螺旋。"
msgstr ""
"Here, $M_i$ is the input moment magnitude, $u_i$ is the projection of the"
" atomic coordinate onto the Cartesian propagation axis $\\hat{\\mathbf "
"n}$, and $s=\\pm1$ denotes the two chiralities. $m_\\parallel=0$ gives a "
"planar spiral, while $0<|m_\\parallel|<1$ gives a conical spiral."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:34
#: 86d34fa7ba5d4c098e75724d302cd705
msgid "勾选公度筛选后，周期必须让所有周期晶格矢量上的相位增量都是 $360°$ 的整数倍；找不到相容周期时会明确失败，不再把原结构当作生成结果。"
msgstr ""
"When commensurability filtering is enabled, the period must make the "
"phase increment along every periodic lattice vector an integer multiple "
"of $360°$. If no compatible period is found, the card fails explicitly "
"instead of treating the unchanged input as a generated result."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:36
#: 7c376ba4a86f43b4bd00c5061824cda4
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:38
#: 83e6b8231bef478d9a21153fdaa6d00f
#
msgid ""
"旧工作流若保存了 $L=20$ Å、双手性和 $m_\\parallel=0$，仍可加载并复现两份平面螺旋结构。若要新建同类路径，在 `SOC /"
" 纹理响应` 中选择 `General spiral`，把传播方向设为原 `axis`，并使用"
msgstr ""
"A legacy workflow saved with $L=20$ Å, both chiralities, and "
"$m_\\parallel=0$ can still be loaded to reproduce two planar spiral "
"structures. To create the same type of path anew, select `General spiral`"
" in `SOC / Texture Response`, set the propagation direction to the old "
"`axis`, and use"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:40
#: 2cebd1e371d9441fa5b3a6c4637a4afe
msgid "|\\mathbf q|=2\\pi/L"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:42
#: 027e52f30c734c4ea6bd8133b1fc111e
msgid "换算基准波矢。运行前应先确认 q 与晶胞共格。"
msgstr ""
"to convert the reference wave vector. Confirm that q is commensurate with"
" the cell before running."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:44
#: bbbce3dbf9994667b989fc497e2a6a07
msgid "迁移到 SOC / 纹理响应"
msgstr "Migrating to SOC / Texture Response"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: b6c77fbcc08b4ff1b556895ea00b228c
msgid "旧版设置"
msgstr "Legacy setting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: f8194042f979413dab42ac73209fbdce
msgid "新版对应设置"
msgstr "Current equivalent"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 7c38a69bd746446ebdc7bc9a3636cad5
msgid "`axis`"
msgstr "`axis`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: a46299fe4a8c485fa0636b0155cd85e4
msgid "`Propagation direction q (Cartesian)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 25669de6485d459380ec2e15eaa21500
msgid "`period_range`"
msgstr "`period_range`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: baf6e119b05a4cb08430a5c2ecdc798d
msgid "将每个 $L$ 换算为 $\\lvert\\mathbf q\\rvert=2\\pi/L$；需要多段时拆成明确路径"
msgstr ""
"Convert each $L$ to $\\lvert\\mathbf q\\rvert=2\\pi/L$; split multiple "
"segments into explicit paths"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 318b5314f6944828bc10a78323581c64
msgid "`angle_gradient_range`"
msgstr "`angle_gradient_range`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 630c60a3615d428b85521cea47f7d4d6
msgid "先用 $L=360/g$ 换算周期，再换算 q"
msgstr "Convert to a period with $L=360/g$, then convert to q"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 545a01983d794822b5e8ff3437cdfad8
msgid "`phase_range`"
msgstr "`phase_range`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 6f79f0a22a9d47ddbf0c4dc76bce1b3a
msgid "`Phase Deg`；多个相位使用多张明确配置"
msgstr "`Phase Deg`; use separate explicit configurations for multiple phases"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: e54c249cf738447395919ebf8a66f868
msgid "`mz`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: aa3be8460d8f4a7f90c5baa7a8f96a1d
msgid "`Cone Component`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 756015b5bf9c4e66af9173b4b946cadc
msgid "`chirality`"
msgstr "`chirality`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 36b8f1e988764a66890a5c2e09def797
msgid "使用正负 q 扫描"
msgstr "Scan positive and negative q"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: ac27549a9da24552ad024a674cd8c859
msgid "`only_commensurate_periods`"
msgstr "`only_commensurate_periods`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 27ae398523904998aafbc74180bca8f3
msgid "`Require Commensurate`，新卡默认开启"
msgstr "`Require Commensurate`, enabled by default in the new card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 0cb5601f8ecc4973b1a91edfaa968da7
msgid "`max_outputs`"
msgstr "`max_outputs`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 5a5e426fe1f84914bc1937762f351df8
msgid "`Max Outputs`；新卡只接受完整路径"
msgstr "`Max Outputs`; the new card accepts complete paths only"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:57
#: 028b04732d814a468f74257a9348ebdf
msgid "`Layer-locked` 没有直接迁移项；如果确实需要离散分层且折返的纹理，使用“折返螺旋磁序”。"
msgstr ""
"`Layer-locked` has no direct migration setting. If a discrete, layer-"
"resolved texture with folding is required, use `Folded Helix`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:59
#: fc3f46451f5b4e17997e4a4a0cc91cf1
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:61
#: cfe831ca0d0444cd88570fdcdfd0d0fd
msgid "以下参数仅用于理解和复现旧 JSON。"
msgstr ""
"The following parameters are documented only for understanding and "
"reproducing legacy JSON."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:63
#: af22e3646c7f4af8a2a88c58d93b44b4
msgid "传播轴（axis）"
msgstr "Propagation Axis (axis)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:65
#: 2c593473742a44d98f4591019fc60982
msgid "笛卡尔三维向量，默认 `(0,0,1)`。原子坐标在该方向上的投影决定螺旋相位。"
msgstr ""
"Three-dimensional Cartesian vector, default `(0,0,1)`. The projection of "
"atomic coordinates along this direction determines the spiral phase."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:67
#: 29a50d39f01e48069a05c64b3a18e28c
msgid "螺旋参数方式（spiral_parameter_mode）"
msgstr "spiral_parameter_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:69
#: f4c044d58fdb44228dc30bf630af392d
msgid "默认 `Period (L_D)`。也可通过 `Angle gradient (deg/A)` 按每 Å 转角定义周期。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Period (L_D)`. The period may instead be defined by rotation per"
" Å using `Angle gradient (deg/A)`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:71
#: 8c77870270704755b3396f1e2fe83040
msgid "周期范围（period_range）"
msgstr "period_range"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:73
#: 9d0fe46e2f424371861e608aef7c4665
msgid "默认 `(20,40,10)` Å，格式为 `[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`。"
msgstr "Default `(20,40,10)` Å, in the form `[minimum, maximum, step]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:75
#: d397f2ab95cc4932a58b663e7ae95141
msgid "角度梯度范围（angle_gradient_range）"
msgstr "angle_gradient_range"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:77
#: 7ef4ab680e7741e598b7576d204ecef9
msgid "默认 `(18,18,1)` 度/Å，格式为 `[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`，与周期满足 $g=360/L$。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(18,18,1)` degrees/Å, in the form `[minimum, maximum, step]`; it"
" is related to the period by $g=360/L$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:79
#: 8e3cb7c6e5b9437593dec7be02b36d43
msgid "相位范围（phase_range）"
msgstr "phase_range"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:81
#: 766c2b40681641f8b2e7b6860275c9d3
msgid "默认 `(0,0,15)` 度。每个相位偏移都会增加一组输出。"
msgstr "Default `(0,0,15)` degrees. Every phase offset adds one output group."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:83
#: c9df8de752004de1b1b91c44af708600
msgid "轴向分量范围（mz）"
msgstr "Axial-Component Range (mz)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:85
#: 82af4c8cdcb148a59e28d720fb02abc8
msgid "默认 `(0,0,0.1)`，表示归一化轴向分量 $m_\\parallel$，范围 `[-1,1]`。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(0,0,0.1)`, representing the normalized axial component "
"$m_\\parallel$ in the range `[-1,1]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:87
#: 244b7d55bfce4515ac892a0190e5534d
msgid "手性（chirality）"
msgstr "chirality"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:89
#: 4b29c56e09d9452a8809622c26d1eab4
msgid "默认 `Both`。`Clockwise` 和 `Counterclockwise` 分别生成一个旋向；`Both` 生成一对。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Both`. `Clockwise` and `Counterclockwise` each generate one "
"handedness; `Both` generates a pair."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:91
#: f8e1a56f88dc442bb68530dbb5aaa805
msgid "相位模式（phase_mode）"
msgstr "phase_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:93
#: 5aad7c4087584bbb9b88d363a02ef369
msgid "默认 `Continuous by position`。`Layer-locked` 会把投影距离足够接近的原子设为相同相位。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Continuous by position`. `Layer-locked` assigns the same phase "
"to atoms whose projected positions are sufficiently close."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:95
#: 6f11f00eadb94047acabe9a0b7230691
msgid "层容差（layer_tolerance）"
msgstr "Layer Tolerance (layer_tolerance)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:97
#: 656128d7b0bb4bddb3d0ce81338052d6
msgid "默认 0.05 Å，仅在 `Layer-locked` 模式下用于合并相邻投影层。"
msgstr ""
"Default 0.05 Å. Used only in `Layer-locked` mode to merge neighboring "
"projected layers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:99
#: 98e5d7eeb40547e9b14ecd46a9e9ffde
msgid "仅保留公度周期（only_commensurate_periods）"
msgstr "Keep Commensurate Periods Only (only_commensurate_periods)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:101
#: 4a94c4a19d234519a45fab0bf4be7cf1
msgid "默认关闭。开启后只生成与当前晶胞和 PBC 相容的周期；找不到时明确报错并尽可能给出超胞倍数建议。"
msgstr ""
"Disabled by default. When enabled, generates only periods compatible with"
" the current cell and PBC. If none is found, it reports an explicit error"
" and, where possible, suggests supercell multipliers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:103
#: c31d17a314464e2a8c1b6ec03d245a46
msgid "磁矩来源（magnitude_source）"
msgstr "Moment Source (magnitude_source)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:105
#: 72a2f742038949049b39a58a8445079e
msgid ""
"默认 `Existing initial magmoms`，要求输入已有至少一个非零磁矩。`Map/default magnitude` "
"才会读取元素表和默认幅值。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Existing initial magmoms`, which requires at least one nonzero "
"input moment. The element map and default magnitude are read only with "
"`Map/default magnitude`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:107
#: 249ca1e8404847eba42e32d1632bc104
msgid "元素磁矩表（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:109
#: 984728d338444e9ab05a20f426be72c2
msgid "元素表模式下使用，格式如 `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`。"
msgstr "Used in element-map mode, in a form such as `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:111
#: 6c8239f8632d4424a5c9d90622ec4445
msgid "默认磁矩（default_moment）"
msgstr "default_moment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:113
#: 4591e4d8f7e94ddaaa3b68438d77e2c0
msgid "默认 0.0。元素表未列出的元素使用该模长。"
msgstr "Default 0.0. Elements absent from the element map use this magnitude."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:115
#: edcb595c479c4ad3bc1e347aaf83d583
msgid "应用元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "apply_elements"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:117
#: 8c42d4e7394b4e2c85b1077dd879a041
msgid "旧实现仅在元素表模式下用它筛选元素；已有磁矩模式不会据此筛选。迁移时应在上游建立明确的参考磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"The legacy implementation uses this to filter elements only in element-"
"map mode; existing-moment mode does not filter by it. When migrating, "
"establish explicit reference moments upstream."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:119
#: 0ca47b27299046c5a4b3f2bcd59f1730
msgid "最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "max_outputs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:121
#: 7f116c78d68c40cf887947bc6eb17507
msgid "默认 100。旧版按周期 × 相位 × 轴向分量 × 手性依次生成，并在达到此数量时截断；新版响应卡只接受完整路径。"
msgstr ""
"Default 100. The legacy card generates period × phase × axial component ×"
" chirality combinations in order and truncates them at this count. The "
"current response card accepts complete paths only."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:123
#: 20b64c1eac864a9d8bc2c08b1f24e3fa
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:125
#: 940b585433444599b3e9b6efccf2e477
msgid "**为什么旧工作流现在会报“没有非零磁矩”？** 旧实现曾原样返回输入并显示成功，这并不是螺旋输出。请在上游写入磁矩，或在旧卡中明确选择元素表来源。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does a legacy workflow now report `no nonzero magnetic moments`?** "
"The old implementation once returned the input unchanged and reported "
"success, which was not a spiral output. Assign moments upstream or "
"explicitly select the element-map source in the legacy card."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:127
#: 8aa1088f3fd149d6ae6c332c693f4bd6
#
msgid "**为什么公度筛选会失败？** 请求区间内没有与当前周期晶胞相容的周期。按错误中的建议扩胞，或迁移到 `SOC / 纹理响应` 后重新设置 q。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does commensurability filtering fail?** The requested range "
"contains no period compatible with the current periodic cell. Expand the "
"cell according to the error's suggestion, or migrate to `SOC / Texture "
"Response` and set q again."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:129
#: f33ff903c95749f589ea118f0596e853
msgid "输出"
msgstr "Output"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:131
#: 827528617fd244e391f355e76614c63e
msgid ""
"成功输出写入 `spin:R:3` 并同步 ASE 初始磁矩；`Config_type` 使用 `Helix(...)` 或 "
"`Spiral(...)`。该操作没有随机性，相同输入与参数产生相同结果。"
msgstr ""
"Successful outputs are written to `spin:R:3` and synchronized with ASE "
"initial magnetic moments; `Config_type` uses `Helix(...)` or "
"`Spiral(...)`. The operation has no randomness, so identical inputs and "
"parameters produce identical results."

